  "description": "“Urban Love” is a bold graffiti font with subtle “love” formations within each character. It’s available in two styles: solid and outline. This font brings an urban and artistic touch to your typography, making it perfect for various design projects, especially those related to love or urban themes. Whether you’re designing posters, logos, or artwork with a bold statement, “Urban Love” offers a unique and eye-catching style that stands out.",
